Findings from HQ (verify them): a message sent at 20:44 got its answer at 20:55. The first attempt used devin and burned about 10 minutes without writing a reply file, only then opencode beam answered. His follow-up messages (20:44 and 20:45) waited behind a file lock and were handled as separate jobs, so a photo and the text that explains it were not seen together.

